#~ msgid ""
#~ "If your system is capable of using the XRender extension for anti-"
#~ "aliasing fonts, then please enter the relevant data."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ako vaš sistem može koristiti XRender proširenje za zaobljavanje (anti-"
#~ "aliasing) fontova, onda molim unesite odgovarajuće podatke."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<b>NOTE</b> As this is the first time this module has been used by you, "
#~ "it has automatically marked the basic folders containing your TrueType "
#~ "and Type1 fonts as needing to be 'configured' - therefore, before closing "
#~ "this module you will be prompted to \"Apply\" these changes. This is "
#~ "necessary even if the folders are empty."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<b>NAPOMENA</b> Pošto je ovo prvi put da koristite ovaj modul, on je "
#~ "automatski označio da osnovni direktoriji koji sadrže vaše TrueType i "
#~ "Type1 fontove moraju biti 'podešeni' - stoga, prije zatvaranja ovog "
#~ "modula bićete upitani da \"Primjenite\" ove izmjene. Ovo je potrebno čak "
#~ "i ako su direktoriji prazni."

